<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Transfers blood from this target to a blood mage. Heals wounds in the process.-->
  <TM_BloodForBloodHD.description>该目标的鲜血流向血法师，并治愈施法者。</TM_BloodForBloodHD.description>
  <!--EN: Blood Drain-->
  <TM_BloodForBloodHD.label>血液流失</TM_BloodForBloodHD.label>
  <!--EN: Accounts for the blood power of a blood mage.-->
  <TM_BloodHD.description>鲜血法师特有的能量。</TM_BloodHD.description>
  <!--EN: Blood Magic-->
  <TM_BloodHD.label>血魔法</TM_BloodHD.label>
  <!--EN: Enveloped in a protective bubble of life energy; energy from each blow to the Blood Shield restores health to the protected pawn.-->
  <TM_BloodShieldHD.description>用施法者的血液能量形成的屏障包围目标。来自护盾的能量将缓慢地再生它所保护的单位。</TM_BloodShieldHD.description>
  <!--EN: Blood Shield-->
  <TM_BloodShieldHD.label>血魄护盾</TM_BloodShieldHD.label>
  <!--EN: A horrendous wound causing massive bleeding.-->
  <TM_RendHD.description>造成大出血。</TM_RendHD.description>
  <!--EN: Hemorrhaging-->
  <TM_RendHD.label>出血</TM_RendHD.label>
